  <diagram name="Page-1" id="mmlFWTiH_VQMhpBT15B4">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2095" dy="1975" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;%%{init: {\n  \&quot;theme\&quot;: \&quot;base\&quot;,\n  \&quot;themeVariables\&quot;: {\n    \&quot;background\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;primaryColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;primaryTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;primaryBorderColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;lineColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;secondaryColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;tertiaryColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;actorBkg\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;actorBorder\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;actorTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;actorLineColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;signalColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;signalTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;labelBoxBkgColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;labelBoxBorderColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;labelTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;loopTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;noteBkgColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;noteBorderColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;noteTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;activationBkgColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;activationBorderColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;\n  }\n}}%%\n\nsequenceDiagram\n    title UC3 — HR Views Daily Bookings\n\n    actor HR\n    participant Page as DailyBookingsPage\n    participant Controller as DailyBookingsController\n    participant UseCase as ViewDailyBookingsUseCase\n    participant Repository as BookingRepository\n    participant DB as Supabase\n\n    HR-&gt;&gt;Page: Open daily bookings page\n    activate Page\n    Page--&gt;&gt;HR: Display empty page and return-time selector\n    deactivate Page\n\n    HR-&gt;&gt;Page: Select return-time slot (4:00 PM or 6:30 PM)\n    activate Page\n\n    Page-&gt;&gt;Controller: viewDailyBookings(returnTime)\n    activate Controller\n\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;Controller: validateReturnTime(returnTime)\n\n    alt Invalid return-time slot\n        Controller--&gt;&gt;Page: Return validation error\n        Page--&gt;&gt;HR: Display validation error\n\n    else Valid return-time slot\n        Controller-&gt;&gt;UseCase: execute(returnTime)\n        activate UseCase\n\n        UseCase-&gt;&gt;Repository: getStopSummaries(returnTime)\n        activate Repository\n\n        Repository-&gt;&gt;DB: execute(Q1, returnTime, CURRENT_DATE)\n        activate DB\n\n        Note over Repository,DB: Group today&#39;s bookings by stop\n\n        DB--&gt;&gt;Repository: Stop names and passenger counts\n        deactivate DB\n\n        Repository--&gt;&gt;UseCase: StopSummary[]\n        deactivate Repository\n\n        alt No bookings for selected slot\n            UseCase-&gt;&gt;UseCase: createEmptyResult()\n\n        else Bookings found\n            loop For each stop summary\n                UseCase-&gt;&gt;Repository: getEmployeesByStop(returnTime, stopId)\n                activate Repository\n\n                Repository-&gt;&gt;DB: execute(Q2, returnTime, stopId, CURRENT_DATE)\n                activate DB\n\n                Note over Repository,DB: Retrieve employees booked for this stop\n\n                DB--&gt;&gt;Repository: Employee names\n                deactivate DB\n\n                Repository--&gt;&gt;UseCase: EmployeeSummary[]\n                deactivate Repository\n            end\n\n            UseCase-&gt;&gt;UseCase: combineStopsCountsAndEmployees()\n        end\n\n        UseCase--&gt;&gt;Controller: DailyBookingView[]\n        deactivate UseCase\n\n        Controller--&gt;&gt;Page: Return daily booking details\n\n        alt DailyBookingView is empty\n            Page--&gt;&gt;HR: Display \&quot;No bookings found\&quot;\n\n        else DailyBookingView contains bookings\n            Page--&gt;&gt;HR: Display stops and passenger counts\n\n            loop For each stop\n                Page--&gt;&gt;HR: Display employee names\n            end\n\n            HR-&gt;&gt;Page: Review daily bookings\n        end\n    end\n\n    deactivate Controller\n    deactivate Page\n\n    Note over Repository,DB: All \&quot;today\&quot; filters use database CURRENT_DATE&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="N-6E1XOkps0U5SRaAy-E-1">
